#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:87
msgid ""
"Work inside the Linux filesystem (``~/`` in WSL), **not** under ``/mnt/c/``."
" Building on the Windows-mounted drive is dramatically slower and can cause "
"file-permission and line-ending problems. Clone the repository into your WSL"
" home directory."
msgstr ""
"Werk binnen het Linux-bestandssysteem (\\ ``~/`` in WSL), **niet** onder "
"``/mnt/c/``\\ . Bouwen op de via Windows aangekoppelde schijf is dramatisch "
"trager en kan problemen met bestandsrechten en regeleindes veroorzaken. "
"Kloon de repository naar je WSL-thuismap."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:92
msgid ""
"To open the project later: launch *Ubuntu* from the Start menu for a shell, "
"or from VS Code on Windows press :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+P` -> *WSL: Connect to "
"WSL*, then *File -> Open Folder* and pick the cloned repo in the Linux "
"filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Om het project later te openen: start *Ubuntu* vanuit het Startmenu voor een"
" shell, of druk vanuit VS Code op Windows op :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+P` -> *WSL: "
"Connect to WSL*\\ , vervolgens *File -> Open Folder* en kies de gekloonde "
"repo in het Linux-bestandssysteem."

